WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Sign in to the local test stack with an administrator account.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Home: the Matters in this workspace. Every record here is invented.

00:09.000 --> 00:15.000
A Matter's documents: 9 ready for Ask Bench and 1 that could not be read, with the reason.

00:15.000 --> 00:21.000
Review: the original document beside the decision panel.

00:21.000 --> 00:27.000
Search: an exact phrase across the Matter, with a note on material that was not fully read.

00:27.000 --> 00:40.000
Ask Bench: the answer cites page 2 of the incident report. The test stack labels it a simulated answer; no live model is called.

00:40.000 --> 00:43.000
The citation opens the source at the quoted passage.

00:43.000 --> 00:47.080
Settings, AI record: spend, money held for running requests, and every question asked.
